			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Note" "Port 1: 1DIR = GND (B->A), 1OE* = GND. Port 2: 2DIR = +3V3 (A->B), 2OE* = JTAG_EN_N. Reading TDO is unconditional and harmless; driving TCK and TMS is not, and is off until the gateware says otherwise."
			(at 951.23 181.61 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "JTAG buffers, part 1. Port 1 is B->A and ALWAYS ON: it reads TDO out of CN1 and drives it onto the cable. Port 2 is A->B and GATED by JTAG_EN_N: TCK and TMS from the cable into CN1"
			(at 951.23 181.61 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
